@startuml
title AC-WF-LL-07 — Video to practice to evidence learning loop
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

' Stable package flow IDs: FLOW-LL-01, FLOW-LL-02, FLOW-LL-03, FLOW-LL-04, FLOW-LL-05

actor Learner
actor "Assigned human reviewer\n(gated)" as Reviewer
participant "LL-MOD-01\nModule roadmap" as Module
participant "LL-VID-01\nVideo viewer" as Video
participant "LL-CAP-01\nCaptions/transcript" as Text
participant "LL-KC-01\nKnowledge check" as Check
participant "LL-QZT-01\nQuiz/test" as Quiz
participant "LL-REF-01\nReflection" as Reflect
participant "LL-IMP-01\nImplementation evidence" as Evidence
participant "LL-REV-01\nHuman review" as Review
participant "LL-IMPR-01\nImprove/retry" as Improve
participant "Canonical learning\nprojection/API" as API
participant "Approved local recovery\n(non-canonical)" as Local
participant "LL-PWA-01 / LL-AUTH-01\nPWA + session boundary" as Recovery

Learner -> Module: open authorized module
Module -> API: read pinned roadmap and next action
API --> Module: current/complete/locked projection
Module --> Learner: show safe roadmap and prerequisite reasons

Learner -> Video: open current activity
Video -> API: read activity authorization and resume metadata
alt media policy/source unavailable
  API --> Video: blocked_media / capability gate
  Video --> Learner: honest blocked state; no fake player
else approved playback session
  API --> Video: scoped session + optional resume
  Learner -> Video: play/pause/seek/speed/fullscreen/PiP
  Video -> Text: request approved captions/transcript
  Text --> Learner: track/panel or unavailable state
  Video -> API: online playback evidence checkpoint
  API --> Video: processing or canonical completion
  alt authored cue reached
    Video -> Check: pause and show stable authored options
    Learner -> Check: select and submit online
    Check -> API: validate authored response
    API --> Check: deterministic feedback or retry
  end
end

Learner -> Quiz: open authored assessment
Quiz -> API: read schema/attempt revision
API --> Quiz: questions and stable option IDs
Learner -> Quiz: answer/review/submit online
Quiz -> API: idempotent revisioned submission
API --> Quiz: recorded result/feedback or retry

Learner -> Reflect: write reflection
Reflect -> Local: optional approved local recovery
Learner -> Reflect: explicit online save
Reflect -> API: If-Match revision save
API --> Reflect: saved / conflict / retry

Learner -> Evidence: record supported implementation evidence
Evidence -> API: append-safe online submission
API --> Evidence: submitted / awaiting review / retry

Evidence -> Review: open when assignment policy allows
Review -> Reviewer: assigned review action only
Reviewer -> Review: add provenance-bearing note/result
Review -> API: append-only review command
API --> Review: visible result or denied/retry
Review --> Learner: human result if policy permits

Learner -> Improve: choose one next behavior or retry
Improve -> API: explicit online save/submit
API --> Improve: canonical completion and next authorized task
Improve --> Learner: named next action; no mastery claim

opt interruption at any stage
  Recovery -> Local: preserve approved local draft only
  Recovery -> API: re-read after reconnect/reauth
  API --> Recovery: latest authorization/revision
  Recovery --> Learner: offline/stale or session-expired recovery
end

note over Video,API
Watch completion is versioned server evidence, not page open, seek, hidden time,
analytics, or a player percentage.
end note
note over Quiz,Review
No autonomous AI scoring, mastery, rank, reward, or competency certification
before AC-SVAL and separate controlled contracts.
end note
note over Local,Recovery
Offline local recovery is not canonical and never performs a hidden canonical
write or background submit. PWA standalone is still a browser surface.
end note
@enduml
